<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Teradyne raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Teradyne raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said analyst Elliot Rogers upgraded Teradyne Inc to buy from accumulate &quot;to reflect a firming order rate, downstream revenue, and EPS outlook, as well as, and most importantly, prospects for material market share gains in Memory and Logic test.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock slipped 1/8 to 22-1/4.</p>
</text>
